 2. **Statistical Matching:** Compute the mean ($\mu$) and standard deviation ($\sigma$) for the chrominance channels ($a$ and $b$) of both images [G].
-   - For the target: $\mu_{a_T}, \sigma_{a_T}, \mu_{b_T}, \sigma_{b_T}$
